{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528650/extras/ezgif-5ac229124a53e4.gif?t=1742230047\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Spin the Fire \u2013 A Spinning Deckbuilding Roguelike \ud83d\udd25</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Spin the Fire</i>, your cards revolve around a flickering campfire, and so does your fate. Every turn, the fire shifts, your choices rotate, and the battle evolves. Manage your <strong>flame-powered</strong> resource wisely\u2014let it burn too bright, and you'll be left in ashes; let it fade, and the darkness will consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by <i>Ring of Pain</i> and <i>Pyrene</i> (<strong>and definitely NOT <i>Slay the Spire</i></strong>), <i>Spin the Fire</i> brings a unique twist to roguelike deckbuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528650/extras/ezgif-31633aa55e3b36.gif?t=1742230047\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Key Features</strong> \ud83d\udd25</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 <strong>A New Kind of Deckbuilder</strong> \u2013 Cards spin around the fire, up to you to mix and refill the cards your delt, at your own risk ! <br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Flame Management</strong> \u2013 Your fire is your lifeline. Keep it fueled to survive, but don\u2019t let it consume you ! <br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Roguelike Intensity</strong> \u2013 Face relentless enemies, make tough decisions, and build the perfect deck to survive. <br>\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>A Killer Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Composed by the talented <strong>J\u00e9r\u00e9mie Fr\u00e9mont (Mod:e)</strong> to keep the heat alive.   <br>\u2728 <strong>VFX Magic</strong> \u2013 Featuring stunning effects from <strong>Cartoon Coffee\u2019s Mega Pack</strong>.   <br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Handcrafted with Passion</strong> \u2013 Designed, programmed, and illustrated by <strong>aznoqmous</strong> in under a month for <i>Boss Rush Jam 2025</i> (<i>theme: SPIN</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to enter the flames!</strong> \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528650/extras/ezgif-35cfc6ed54bf5a.gif?t=1742230047\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Content\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udd25</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo now includes :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 equipment cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 foliage cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 zones with their own boss(es) and soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and more to come !</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528650?t=1742230047","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528650/6ca9de19820c12515f08605d6716b8c006dbdde6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742230047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528650/96a666d3ff5cfe62e1ce62b2af516aa85220b6c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742230047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528650/96a666d3ff5cfe62e1ce62b2af516aa85220b6c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742230047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3528690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528650/extras/ezgif-5ac229124a53e4.gif?t=1742230047\" /></p><p class=\"bb_p